#import "lib.typ": *

= 1a Formal Notation (from chapter 1.1.5)

#definition()[
  *Sequence* (tuple): $(x_j)_(j=1)^n = (x_1, x_2, ..., x_n)$
]

#definition()[
  *Range*: $[n] = {1, 2, ..., n}$
]

#definition()[
  *Sum*: accumulation over index $i = m, m+1, ..., n$.
  #align(center)[$sum_(i=m)^n x_i = x_m + x_(m+1) + ... + x_n$]
  *Empty sum* equals $0$ (can be vector or matrix)
]

- *Number of Terms*: $n - m + 1$
- Same with product $product_(i=m)^n x_i= x_1 x_2 ... x_n$.

#definition()[
  *Sets*: unordered collection; ignores duplicates; notation: ${ dots }$
]

#definition()[
  *Natural numbers*: $NN = {0, 1, 2, ...}$
]
